            <ArticleTitle>Obesity and disability in older adults.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>40-47</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000513339.69567.75</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The prevalence of obesity and disability in older adults has significant public health implications. This case review discusses the benefits and risks of weight loss in older adults and outlines treatment options available to Medicare beneficiaries. The importance of preserving lean muscle mass in weight management is emphasized.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
